{"title":"Sunday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/910871738/0/marginalrevolution~Sunday-assorted-links.html","date":1736700029000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.theatlantic.com/international/archive/2025/01/havana-syndrome-russia-intelligence/681282/\" target=\"_blank\">Cracks in the silence about Havana Syndrome</a> (Atlantic).</p>\r\n<p>2. “As Rainer Zitelmann, a noted historian of the Third Reich, has pointed out, the AfD has long since abandoned its former economic liberalism for a Right-wing form of anti-capitalism. Its rhetoric is often indistinguishable from that of the far-Left Die Linke, or the Left populist Bündnis Sahra Wagenknecht.” (<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.telegraph.co.uk/news/2025/01/10/musk-not-wrong-hitler-anti-capitalist/\" target=\"_blank\">Brendan Simms in the Telegraph</a>)</p>\r\n<p>3. “<span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ft.com/content/fb0c4c61-6541-485e-8034-12e115100338\" target=\"_blank\">Australia appoints first rabbit tsar to combat invasive species.</a>” (FT)</span></p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://chatgpt.com/share/6782d87a-82e4-8010-acb2-f47bbcd00770\" target=\"_blank\">o1 pro answers a question about intra-profile social welfare theory</a>, a’la Kevin Roberts.  Wake up, people!  I start it off with the Harberger tax model, but perhaps that is too easy to still be impressive these days?</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/jon_hartley_/status/1878179455266705456?s=46&amp;t=vlOx_VP4F1QeP_EhKzkNqQ\" target=\"_blank\"><span>University of Chicago economics professor </span><span>Casey Mulligan </span></a><span>appointed Chief Counsel for Advocacy at the U.S. Small Business Administration.</span></p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/clownbasket/status/1877853487809098232?s=46&amp;t=4zK71rrOpaO1JgMIHK8KpA\" target=\"_blank\">The law and economics of a fire disaster</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/ianpacemain/status/1878217436744303038\" target=\"_blank\">Schoenberg archive destroyed by the fire</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/Grimezsz/status/1878195253943124071\" target=\"_blank\">Robin Hanson is underrated with Grimes</a>.</p>\r\n<p>8. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.google.com/search?q=soundtrack+to+a+coup+d%27etat&amp;sca_esv=56f381dcf9f4ef77&amp;source=hp&amp;ei=ixGDZ-mXB5bj5NoP7eaGuQI&amp;iflsig=AL9hbdgAAAAAZ4Mfm37JJqZEwzjebB9_ufwDJTObNyf1&amp;gs_ssp=eJzj4tVP1zc0LK40zCnOtkwxYPSSLs4vzUspKUpMzlYoyVdIVEjOLy1QSFFPLUksAQBB_g7L&amp;oq=soundtrack+to+a+co&amp;gs_lp=Egdnd3Mtd2l6IhJzb3VuZHRyYWNrIHRvIGEgY28qAggAMgsQLhiABBixAxiDATIFEAAYgAQyBRAAGIAEMgUQABiABDIFEAAYgAQyBRAAGIAEMgUQABiABDIFEAAYgAQyBRAAGIAEMgUQABiABEiXI1AAWLMScAB4AJABAJgBP6ABxQaqAQIxOLgBAcgBAPgBAZgCEqAC_AbCAgsQABiABBixAxiDAcICDhAAGIAEGLEDGIMBGIoFwgIREC4YgAQYsQMY0QMYgwEYxwHCAg4QLhiABBixAxjRAxjHAcICCBAAGIAEGLEDwgILEC4YgAQY0QMYxwHCAg4QLhiABBixAxiDARiKBcICDhAuGIAEGLEDGIMBGNQCwgIIEC4YgAQYsQPCAg4QLhiABBjHARiOBRivAcICBRAuGIAEmAMAkgcCMTigB7PZAQ&amp;sclient=gws-wiz\" target=\"_blank\">Soundtrack to a Coup d’Etat is an excellent movie</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/sunday-assorted-links-502.html\">Sunday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/910871738/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/91087173